WEBVTT

00:05:59.063 --> 00:06:01.399
it's understood I am from the city.

00:06:02.108 --> 00:06:05.736
So I tell people I'm a researcher
into female hygiene.

00:06:06.987 --> 00:06:10.241
I started carrying
sanitary napkins in my purse.

00:06:11.784 --> 00:06:13.285
Men are so embarrassed,

00:06:14.328 --> 00:06:15.579
they leave me alone.

00:06:15.621 --> 00:06:18.707
(Laughter)

00:06:18.707 --> 00:06:21.544
(Applause)

00:06:22.086 --> 00:06:24.255
The women offer me tea,

00:06:24.296 --> 00:06:26.966
and I sit and chat with them for hours,

00:06:26.966 --> 00:06:28.801
until they get bored of me.

00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:31.595
That's when my real work begins.